1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,563
My father hid a letter under his
truck seat for fifteen years.

2
00:00:04,563 --> 00:00:05,119
Stamped.

3
00:00:05,119 --> 00:00:06,232
Addressed to me.

4
00:00:06,232 --> 00:00:08,319
Dated the morning I left home.

5
00:00:08,319 --> 00:00:09,780
We never spoke again.

6
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:12,075
When he died, I finally found it.

7
00:00:12,075 --> 00:00:17,918
And at the bottom, in different ink, written
years later, he'd added two more lines.

8
00:00:17,918 --> 00:00:19,796
"Saw the weather in Nevada.

9
00:00:19,796 --> 00:00:21,465
Glad you took the exit."

10
00:00:21,465 --> 00:00:23,830
I never told him about that night.

11
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:25,221
I never told anyone.

12
00:00:25,221 --> 00:00:27,030
So how did my father know?
